@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8089/api
@buyerToken = REPLACE_WITH_BUYER_TOKEN
@sellerToken = REPLACE_WITH_SELLER_TOKEN
@productId = 1
@sellerUserId = 2
@negotiationId = 1

### 买家发起议价
POST {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": {{productId}},
  "sellerUserId": {{sellerUserId}},
  "proposedPrice": 76.00
}

### 卖家查看与该买家、商品有关的议价
GET {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/list?productId={{productId}}&counterpartUserId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 卖家确认并创建待付款订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "negotiationId": {{negotiationId}},
  "confirmedPrice": 76.00,
  "createOrder": true
}

### 或者卖家拒绝
POST {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/{{negotiationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
